  1979                           ;	MCLRE = OFF, RE3/MCLR pin function is digital input, MCLR internally tied to VDD
  1980                           ;	Code Protection bit
  1981                           ;	CP = OFF, Program memory code protection is disabled
  1982                           ;	Data Code Protection bit
  1983                           ;	CPD = OFF, Data memory code protection is disabled
  1984                           ;	Brown Out Reset Selection bits
  1985                           ;	BOREN = ON, BOR enabled
